<name>Engine</name>
<section id="10006_S000J" variety="S000J">
<name>Engine Control</name>
<ttl id="10006_S000J_74WIJ_T00FO" variety="T00FO">
<name>EFI System (2GR-FE)</name>
<para id="X39400000RM022C" category="C" type-id="302ES" name-id="066OH-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P2111/41</dtccode>
<dtcname>Throttle Body Stuck Open</dtcname>
<dtccode>P2112/41</dtccode>
<dtcname>Throttle Body Stuck Closed</dtcname>
<subpara id="X39400000RM022C_10" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DBA00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>The throttle valve is operated by the throttle motor through gears. The throttle valve opening angle is detected by the throttle position sensor and fed back to the engine control computer. When a DTC is stored, the engine control computer cuts off the current to the throttle motor. The throttle valve is returned to a specified opening angle (6°) by the return spring.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="1.498008     in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="3.154628     in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="2.494272     in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTCNo.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Malfunction Duration</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Others</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P2111/41</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Throttle motor stuck on open side (throttle valve, reduction gear or throttle motor locked)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>0.5 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Throttle Body Assembly (with Motor)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness or Connector</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P2112/41</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Throttle motor stuck on closed side (throttle valve, reduction gear or throttle motor locked)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>0.5 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Throttle Body Assembly (with Motor</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
