</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RM022C_11" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DBB00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze data. Freeze data records part of the engine operating condition when a malfunction occurs, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RM022C_12" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000RM022C_12_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DBC00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Throttle Body Assembly (w/ Motor) (Throttle Valve)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the air cleaner cap w/ air cleaner hose.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check for foreign matter between the throttle valve and housing; if any, remove it and clean.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the throttle valve moves smoothly when moved by hand to the fully open position.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the throttle valve moves smoothly when moved by hand to the fully closed position.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the throttle valve returns smoothly to the opener position when released.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RM022C_12_0006" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000RM022C_12_0004" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RM022C_12_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DBE00000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and clear the DTCs following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000008YS014X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RM022C_12_0002" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RM022C_12_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DBD00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Perform a road test.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and check the DTCs following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref href="RM0000008YS014X" label="Seep02"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.97in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.16in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>P2111/41, P2112/41 displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Normal code displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The DTC judgment can be confirmed using the [Diagnosis Judgment Result Check] function of SST (TaSCAN). (see <xref href="RM0000008YS014X" label="Seep03"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RM022C_12_0003" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000RM022C_12_0005" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RM022C_12_0003">
<testtitle>Replace Engine Control Computer<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002ADB004X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RM022C_12_0004">
<testtitle>Replace Throttle Body Assembly (w/ Motor)<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020UO00AX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RM022C_12_0005">
<testtitle>Return to Normal</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
